+++
+++```yaml
+++appId: com.example.app
+++---
+++- repeat:
+++    times: ${CYCLES}
+++    commands:
+++      - tapOn:
+++          id: "open_player"
+++      - assertVisible:
+++          id: "player"
+++      - back
+++```
